1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/fosa/fosa-ch7","children":["FOSA丨07丨架构特性范围"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],"$undefined",["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"架构设计"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"FOSA丨07丨架构特性范围"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本篇通过回答《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》第七章的课后思考题，深入探讨架构量子的概念与定义、架构特性的作用范围以及量子边界的识别方法，分析系统组件间的同步依赖关系对架构分解的影响，帮助理解如何基于功能内聚性和部署依赖性来合理划分架构边界，优化系统的可部署性、可测试性和可维护性。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-07-08T11:00:00.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/07/08"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","3,355"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":["本系列文章通过逐章回答",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":13,"offset":12},"end":{"line":1,"column":52,"offset":51}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":12,"offset":11},"end":{"line":1,"column":102,"offset":101}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》"}],"（下文简称 FOSA）一书中的课后思考题，来深入理解书中的核心概念和理论，从而提升我们的软件架构设计能力。本篇为",["$","u","u-0",{"children":"第七章"}],"内容。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"本章的课后题是："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What is an architectural quantum, and why is it important to architecture?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"为什么是架构量子？它为什么对架构很重要？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Assume a system consisting of a single user interface with four independently deployed services, each containing its own separate database. Would this system have a single quantum or four quanta? Why?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"假设一个系统包含一个单一的用户界面，以及四个独立部署的服务，每个服务都包含自己的独立数据库。这个系统会有一个量子还是四个量子？为什么？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Assume a system with an administration portion managing static reference data (such as the product catalog, and warehouse information) and a customer-facing portion managing the placement of orders. How many quanta should this system be and why? If you envision multiple quanta, could the admin quantum and customer-facing quantum share a database? If so, in which quantum would the database need to reside?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"假设一个系统包含两个部分："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"管理后台"}],"：负责管理静态参考数据（例如产品目录、仓库信息）。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"用户端"}],"：负责处理客户订单的下达。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["这个系统应该被划分为多少个 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"量子"}],"？为什么？如果您设想这是多个量子，那二者可以共享同一个数据库吗？如果可以，该数据库需要驻留在哪个量子中？"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-0",{}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"什么是架构量子","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#什么是架构量子","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#什么是架构量子"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"什么是架构量子？","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":4,"offset":1146},"end":{"line":24,"column":12,"offset":1154}}}]},"children":"什么是架构量子？"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"架构量子 (Architectural Quantum)"}]," 这个概念源于 Neal Ford、Mark Richards 等人在《软件架构：艰难的部分》(Software Architecture: The Hard Parts) 一书中提出的。它的核心定义是："]}],"\n",["$","blockquote","blockquote-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["一个",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"架构量子"}],"是指一个系统中，具有","$L8"," 和","$L9"," 的、可独立部署的组件的最小集合。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27"]}]}],"$L28","$L29","$L2a"]}],"$L2b"]}]]}]}]
